{"t":"Decaying Defender Outfits Quest","s":"decaying-defender-outfits-quest-1d8e6","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Outfit_Decaying_Defender_Male_Addon_3_98147f.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Decaying Defender Outfits Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">250<br/>(700+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">13.20.13560<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 10, 2023<br/>Summer Update 2023</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This quest has no legend.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>All the locations of the <a href=\"#/quest/rotten-blood-quest\">Rotten Blood Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p>Creatures and bosses found in the <a href=\"#/quest/rotten-blood-quest\">Rotten Blood Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Decaying%20Defender%20Outfits\">Decaying Defender Outfits</a> and addons, <a href=\"#/wiki/Achievements\">achievement</a>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Fully%20Decayed\">Fully Decayed</a> <br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Decaying%20Defender%20Outfits\"><img alt=\"Decaying Defender Outfits\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Decaying_Defender_Male_Addon_3_98147f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Decaying%20Defender%20Outfits\"><img alt=\"Decaying Defender Outfits\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Decaying_Defender_Female_Addon_3_ddbbf7.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Base_Outfits\">Base Outfits</span></h2>\n<p>Finish the <a href=\"#/quest/rotten-blood-quest\">Rotten Blood Quest</a> by defeating <a href=\"#/wiki/Bakragore\">Bakragore</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-First_Addon\">First Addon</span></h2>\n<p>Use a piece of <a href=\"#/wiki/Cursed%20Wood\">Cursed Wood</a>. <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cursed%20Wood\"><img alt=\"Cursed Wood\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cursed_Wood_faef8c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Second_Addon\">Second Addon</span></h2>\n<p>Use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Geode\">Darklight Geode</a>. <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Darklight%20Geode\"><img alt=\"Darklight Geode\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Darklight_Geode_4237e0.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span>\n</p><p>Upon using both items you will get the achievement <a href=\"#/wiki/Fully%20Decayed\">Fully Decayed</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["rotten-blood-quest"]}